OL,3,ADetective stole more than #85,000 from
OL,4,Apolice force
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former police detective who stole
OL,7,Fmore than #85,000 from her own force
OL,8,Fwhile working in a team that
OL,9,Finvestigated high-level drugs gangs has
OL,10,Fbeen jailed.
OL,12,FActing as the exhibits officer and one
OL,13,Fof only a small number of people with
OL,14,Faccess to a safe that contained
OL,15,Fhundreds of thousands of pounds,
OL,16,FMichelle Kirsty Reason began siphoning
OL,17,Foff cash in January 2022, Derbyshire
OL,18,FPolice said.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
