OL,3,ADetective stole more than #85,000 from
OL,4,Apolice force
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the force, the 54-year-old
OL,7,Fspent the money - which had been seized
OL,8,Ffrom criminals - on a car, a holiday,
OL,9,Fand tickets to events.
OL,11,FOn Monday, Reason pleaded guilty to
OL,12,Ftheft and misconduct in public office
OL,13,Fand was jailed for four years and two
OL,14,Fmonths at Mansfield Magistrates' and
OL,15,FCounty Court.
